<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="badge">GOLD CALCULATOR</view>
    <view class="title">黄金持仓计算器</view>
    <view class="subtitle">加仓 / 减仓后的成本均价与收益测算</view>
  </view>

  <view class="wrap">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <view class="bar"></view>
        <text class="title-text">持仓信息</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label"><text>原成本均价</text><text class="hint">买入时的平均成本</text></view>
        <view class="input-box">
          <input type="digit" value="{{cost}}" bindinput="onCostInput" placeholder="例如 480" placeholder-class="ph" />
          <text class="suffix">元/g</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label"><text>当前持有克数</text><text class="hint">操作前的持仓</text></view>
        <view class="input-box">
          <input type="digit" value="{{grams}}" bindinput="onGramsInput" placeholder="例如 100" placeholder-class="ph" />
          <text class="suffix">g</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label"><text>现黄金价格</text><text class="hint">当前成交/参考价</text></view>
        <view class="input-box">
          <input type="digit" value="{{price}}" bindinput="onPriceInput" placeholder="例如 560" placeholder-class="ph" />
          <text class="suffix">元/g</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <view class="bar"></view>
        <text class="title-text">操作设置</text>
        <button class="example" bindtap="onExample" size="mini">填入示例</button>
      </view>

      <view class="segment">
        <view class="segment-item {{mode === 'add' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="onModeAdd">加仓（买入）</view>
        <view class="segment-item {{mode === 'sell' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="onModeSell">减仓（卖出）</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label"><text>{{amountLabel}}</text><text class="hint">{{amountHint}}</text></view>
        <view class="input-box">
          <input type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="onAmountInput" placeholder="例如 10000" placeholder-class="ph" />
          <text class="suffix">元</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="warning">{{warning}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="hero">
      <view class="hero-label">{{heroLabel}}</view>
      <view class="hero-big">{{newCost}}<text class="hero-unit">元/g</text></view>
      <view class="hero-sub">{{heroSub}}</view>
      <view class="stats">
        <view class="stat">
          <view class="stat-k">{{gramsK}}</view>
          <view class="stat-v">{{newGrams}} <text class="mini">g</text></view>
        </view>
        <view class="stat">
          <view class="stat-k">{{deltaK}}</view>
          <view class="stat-v {{deltaCls}}">{{delta}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <view class="bar"></view>
        <text class="title-text">{{detailTitle}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="grid">
        <view class="cell {{index % 2 === 1 ? 'last' : ''}}" wx:for="{{details}}" wx:key="key">
          <view class="cell-k">{{item.label}}</view>
          <view class="cell-v {{item.cls}}">{{item.value}}<text class="cell-unit" wx:if="{{item.unit}}">{{item.unit}}</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="note">
      计算说明：加仓按「金额 ÷ 现价」折算新增克数，新旧成本合并后摊薄均价；减仓按「金额 ÷ 现价」折算卖出克数，采用平均成本法结转已实现盈亏，剩余持仓的成本均价保持不变。结果未计入手续费、点差及税费，仅供参考。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
